# Overrides systemd's rule of the same name: no v4l_id probing of video nodes.
# On the PICO 4 kernel, the camera nodes go through PICO's CAM-HUB, which opens
# the real devices on one work queue. v4l_id opening the ICP node at boot (its
# firmware load fails) blocks that queue, and every later open of cam_sync then
# times out, so the tracking cameras cannot be used. The persistent /dev/v4l
# links this rule would create are not needed.
